#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[[!meta title=\"Office suite\"]]\n"
msgstr "[[!meta title=\"Suite Ofimática\"]]\n"

#. type: Plain text
msgid ""
"Tails includes *[LibreOffice](https://www.libreoffice.org/)*, a powerful "
"office suite which embeds several tools:"
msgstr ""
"Tails incluye *[LibreOffice](https://www.libreoffice.org/)*, "
"una poderosa suite ofimática que integra varias herramientas:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
msgid "*Writer*, a word processor"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "***Calc***, a spreasheet application"
msgid "*Calc*, a spreasheet application"
msgstr "***Calc***, una aplicación de hoja de cálculo"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "***Impress***, a presentation engine"
msgid "*Impress*, a presentation engine"
msgstr "***Impress***, una herramienta para presentaciones"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "***Draw***, a drawing and flowcharting application"
msgid "*Draw*, a drawing and flowcharting application"
msgstr "***Draw***, una aplicación de dibujo y de diagramas de flujo"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "To start *LibreOffice* choose\n"
#| "<span class=\"menuchoice\">\n"
#| "  **Applications**&nbsp;▸\n"
#| "  **Office**&nbsp;▸\n"
#| "  **LibreOffice**</span>.\n"
msgid ""
"To start *LibreOffice* choose **Applications&nbsp;▸ Office&nbsp;▸ "
"LibreOffice**."
msgstr ""
"Para empezar *LibreOffice* elige\n"
"<span class=\"menuchoice\">\n"
"  **Aplicaciones**&nbsp;▸\n"
"  **Oficina**&nbsp;▸\n"
"  **LibreOffice**</span>.\n"

#. type: Plain text
msgid ""
"The *LibreOffice* website provides complete [user guides](https://wiki."
"documentfoundation.org/Documentation/Publications) for each of these tools, "
"translated into several languages."
msgstr ""
"El sitio web *LibreOffice* proporciona [guías "
"de usuario](https://wiki.documentfoundation.org/Documentation/Publications) "
"para cada una "
"de estas herramientas, traducidas a varios idiomas."

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "To use *LibreOffice* in your language, you can\n"
#| "install the <span class=\"command\">libreoffice-l10n-<span class=\"command-placeholder\">lang</span></span>\n"
#| "package using the [[Additional Software|doc/first_steps/additional_software]]\n"
#| "feature. Replace <span class=\"command-placeholder\">lang</span> with the code\n"
#| "for your language. For example, <code>es</code> for Spanish or <code>de</code>\n"
#| "for German.\n"
msgid ""
"To use *LibreOffice* in your language, you can\n"
"install the <code>libreoffice-l10n-<span class=\"command-placeholder\">lang</span></code>\n"
"package using the [[Additional Software|persistent_storage/additional_software]]\n"
"feature. Replace <span class=\"command-placeholder\">lang</span> with the code\n"
"for your language. For example, `vi` for Vietnamese.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para utilizar *LibreOffice* en tu idioma, puedes\n"
"instalar el paquete <span class=\"command\">libreoffice-l10n-<span class=\"command-placeholder\">idioma</span></span>\n"
" utilizando la opción [[Additional Software|doc/first_steps/additional_software]].\n"
"Reemplaza <span class=\"command-placeholder\">lang</span> con el código\n"
"para tu idioma. Por ejemplo, <code>es</code> para español o <code>de</code>\n"
"para alemán.\n"

#. type: Plain text
msgid ""
"Tails already includes language packages for Arabic, German, Spanish, Farsi, "
"French, Hindi, Bahasa Indonesia, Italian, Portuguese, Russian, Turkish, and "
"Simplified Chinese."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
msgid ""
"[List of available *LibreOffice* language packages](https://packages.debian."
"org/search?keywords=libreoffice-l10n&searchon=names&suite=stable&section=all)"
msgstr ""

